* GENCOM - ATTACH RSX MODULES TO A PROGRAM

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* GENCOM - ATTACH RSX MODULES TO A PROGRAM

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:GENCOM program [rsx-module ...]

Builds or changes a CP/M 3 COM program with resident extension modules.
This rewrites executable files and can affect loading and memory
allocation.

Work on a backed-up copy and retain the corresponding RSX sources and
configuration. It is a maintenance/build tool, not the command to start an
ordinary program.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
